#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/index.rst:2
msgid "模型（9 项）"
msgstr "Models (9 items)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/index.rst:4
msgid "使用各类AI模型对图像和视频进行分析和预测。"
msgstr "Use various AI models to analyze and predict images and videos."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/index.rst:25
msgid ":ref:`自动分割模型` 无需训练即可进行实例分割。"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Automatic segmentation model` performs instance segmentation without "
"training."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/index.rst:27
msgid ":ref:`DaoAI World模型` 使用 DaoAI World 训练的模型对图像进行推理。"
msgstr ""
":ref:`DaoAI World model` uses a model trained by DaoAI World to perform "
"inference on images."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/index.rst:29
msgid ":ref:`人脸识别模型` 在图像中检测和识别人脸，通过搜索已知人脸库识别身份。"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Face recognition model` detects and recognizes faces in images and "
"identifies identities by searching a library of known faces."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/index.rst:32
msgid ":ref:`通用分析模型` 无需训练即可使用属性对检测到的物体进行分类。"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Universal Analysis Model` uses attributes to classify detected objects"
" without training."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/index.rst:34
msgid ":ref:`通用分类模型` 无需训练即可运行通用图像分类模型。"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Universal Classification Model` Runs a general image classification "
"model without training."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/index.rst:36
msgid ":ref:`通用检测模型(快)` 无需训练即可运行物体检测模型。"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Universal Detection Model (Fast)` Runs object detection models without"
" training."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/index.rst:39
msgid ":ref:`通用实例分割模型` 使用通用模型进行实例分割。"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Universal Instance Segmentation Model` Use a universal model for "
"instance segmentation."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/index.rst:41
msgid ":ref:`通用物体检测模型` 使用通用模型进行物体检测。"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Universal Object Detection Model` Use a universal model for object "
"detection."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/index.rst:43
msgid ":ref:`人体姿态评估` 进行人体姿态估计。"
msgstr ":ref:`Human pose assessment` performs human pose estimation."
